{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_03",
  "title": "黃金蘿蔔",
  "storyCode": "DT-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "76800ded5ee26cb3e3f8fd86354d54b0c9bc6e8759ebc1a7629ba18b0ce8158a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "呼……呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "（哼歌）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這片荒地根本看不到頭，我們要走到什麼時候啊——\n喂，你這傢伙也太開心了吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "（哼歌）因為我得到了一件這個世界的魔法器具呀~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "不過就是別人不要的東西……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "哼，難道你看到一種全新的開鎖工具不會覺得開心嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "來到這個世界後，我一直覺得自己的魔法施展得沒有之前那麼順暢了，這裡好像有一股我無法利用的……奇怪的魔力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "但是現在我有了這個D32鋼手電筒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "老闆說這種叫“D32鋼”的材料可以承載更大的能量輸出，這裡的魔法師會用它來做魔法器具，說不定我能透過它更好地使用魔法呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "而且我親眼見到老闆用它施放了類似閃光魔法的法術！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫總覺得，世上不會有不需要付出努力就可以得到的好東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "可能老闆不希望好東西被白白浪費，就送給了我這個超厲害的魔法師吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我現在對這個世界的魔法原理超感興趣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯……那要不要趁現在多練習練習？瑪露希爾，你能試試用它把那些果子弄下來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "這裡長果子的樹真的很少，也就水邊有這麼幾棵，錯過了可能就沒有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "其實是你想吃看看那些果子吧……\n好吧，就當作是練習吧，我試試好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一片安靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "什麼都沒有發生呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "怎、怎麼可能！之前在老闆手裡明明還能正常用的，而且我有感覺到它在回應我……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "那就是錯覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "哼！我試一遍！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "唔唔……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "又是一片安靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "還是什麼都沒有發生喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，這個什麼手電筒你真的能用嗎……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "要不然還是用法杖吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不過是還需要適應的問題！只要給我一點時間，我就能弄懂……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "呼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嘿……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "哦！成功了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，你果然……呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "怎麼你炸的是自己？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "咳咳咳咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "咳咳咳咳！咳咳咳咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……都說了不要逞強硬來啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "怎麼回事……為什麼魔法會從這個魔法器具的尾端冒出來……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "他們這裡的魔法器具怎麼這麼難控制……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "所以老夫很討厭魔法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "這不一樣……！咳咳咳咳咳！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "下一次，下一次我一定就能成功了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "老闆！這個D32鋼手電筒好像有問題——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "不是吧！白送給你我最寶貝的D32鋼手電筒，還要被你們找麻煩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "咳咳……沒有！我只是想問問，你們這裡還有相關的書賣嗎？我還是想有系統地學一下……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "那沒有，你以為我這裡是什麼地方？這就是一個快要倒閉的工廠，除了已經做好的武器以外就是些礦石機器，別的都沒有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "你要是不想要就還給我！……我就知道，沒有一個識貨的！難道它不酷嗎？你甚至能用它照亮整片夜空！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "這麼好用的東西大家卻不懂得欣賞，一個都沒賣出去……害得我的工廠都要倒閉了……我本來以為終於遇到了一個有眼光的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我、我不是這個意思……！既然沒有就算了，等我研究明白這裡的魔法原理，我再試試看！總之……謝謝老闆的禮物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "那我們還是繼續去找羅德島吧——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "欸？又要去那片荒地嗎？這個世界太大了，光靠雙腳走，在找到羅德島之前我們就會累死吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯……好像沒看到這裡有馬車，但是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "老闆，你的這個……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "車？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "喔，原來這種東西也是車……它多少錢呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "哼！雖然我的工廠要倒閉了，但這輛車還是值點錢的，你們看起來不像是能買得起的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "但我們靠走真的能找到羅德島嗎……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "老闆，給你，午飯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "text": "不過老闆，工廠都要倒閉了，能賣點就賣點吧，要不然薪水都發不出來……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "text": "蘿蔔飯糰都吃多久了，之前你還說今天的散夥飯要請大家吃黃金蘿蔔燒烤，希望大家邁向新未來呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "那我也要有錢請你們吃啊，把車賣了我就什麼都沒有了……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "好了，幾位，我們也要開始整理做散夥飯的東西了，就不招呼你們了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "……散夥飯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "唉，蘿蔔和米都在那，也沒什麼要準備的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "text": "我們開廠第一頓飯吃的就是黃金蘿蔔呢……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "唉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "要是能幫你們變出來黃金蘿蔔，我早就變出來了。現在不是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "要是有能力，我也想把這個儀式持續下去……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "你們這裡吃黃金蘿蔔……是傳統嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "嗯，是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "只要是聚餐，我們都會有一道黃金蘿蔔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "text": "但今天也沒辦法了吧，現在去哪裡弄黃金蘿蔔？散夥飯嘛，有烤肉配著蘿蔔片包米飯吃，也就差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "能把你們的食材都給老夫看看嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "就是這幾筐蘿蔔和那邊的肉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "text": "……你要幹嘛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "把食材都交給老夫吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫幫你們做一頓飯，讓你們能夠好好地互相告別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主&工人",
      "text": "……啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "你……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "（小聲）先西為什麼這樣……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "（小聲）你忘了，他加入我們小隊就是因為看不下去萊歐斯做飯啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "（小聲）他大概是很難接受別人不好好吃飯吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "吃飯不僅僅是生活的一部分，其中還寄託了人們的情感……老夫都明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫會幫你們弄到黃金蘿蔔的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "真、真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "蘿蔔你們這裡倒是有很多，老夫也能夠幫你們做出一頓飯來，但是黃金蘿蔔到底是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "就是金色的蘿蔔嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "你們幾個不是雷姆必拓人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "黃金蘿蔔可是我們這裡的傳統美食。又有礦石又有蘿蔔，雷姆必拓兩大特色！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "你們還吃礦石？是怎麼料理的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "text": "吃礦石？怎麼可能！黃金蘿蔔上面的金粉是“赤金源石蟲”的分泌物做的，只不過我們現在沒辦法專門花錢買這種東西了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "text": "不過要是能找到赤金源石蟲，現做也完全沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "那哪裡會有這種赤金源石蟲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "礦洞裡，荒野上，只要人少的地方都可能有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "吶，那邊的坑洞一看就是源石蟲的巢穴，那邊的礦洞口也有兩個巢穴，再那邊的洞口已經長草了，看來是被源石蟲廢棄了，應該是空的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "不過這附近的赤金源石蟲都被抓得差不多了，應該有點難找到呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "text": "那個，雖然說工廠要倒閉了，但我最後一天的工作還沒做完……要是你們能找到赤金源石蟲，我們真的會非常感謝你們的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "（小聲）雖然肚子確實有點餓了，但我們去羅德島的事怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "那如果我們幫你們做出黃金蘿蔔的話，你能不能考慮便宜賣我們這輛車的事情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廠主",
      "text": "……我……我會考慮的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "這裡一定有源石蟲，我都聽到牠們爬行的聲音了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "呃……這麼多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "我們要怎麼找到赤金源石蟲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "而且源石蟲我們見過，也就大鮑勃能讓牠們安靜下來，牠們攻擊性挺強的，看起來不像是能簡單地獲得牠們分泌物的樣子啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "看來……只能戰鬥了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "你們都讓開，讓我再試一下這個魔法器具，這次我一定能用它正常放出魔法！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪露希爾舉起D32鋼手電筒，閉上雙眼，努力地感受蘊含在其中的能量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "她剛才可是失敗了的，現在真的可以嗎……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "——欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "手電筒發出的光芒並沒有因為先西的打斷而停下，反而更加耀眼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，不要把牠們全殺了，要殺就一隻一隻地——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "等等，先西……現在好像不是說這個的時候……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "瑪露希爾拿的那個東西好像……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪露希爾身旁逐漸顯現出耀眼的光芒，她的頭髮隨著力量的波動飛舞起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯&奇爾查克",
      "text": "要張不開眼睛了……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "怎、怎麼回事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "那邊的源石蟲好像發現我們了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我看到了，我、我沒辦法很好地控制這個魔法器具……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "沒關係，瑪露希爾，你再試一下，說不定就能成功了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "感受魔力從四周被汲取而來，力量從我的指尖流向魔法器具，然後放出——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "魔法的學習與施展，需要在一次次的突破中更加專注、更加嚴謹、更加真誠。\n真正需要的是對魔法的那份至高理念的理解、接受和覺悟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在這時，瑪露希爾對於這個世界中全新的魔法的嚮往令她創造出了一份奇蹟——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "成功了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "成功了……嗎？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石蟲群",
      "text": "（謹慎地停下）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我不清楚，好像我剛才釋放出了一個什麼東西，但是它消失了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不過我現在又感受到它的存在了……小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "它比我預計的還要猛烈很多！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "…………！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我感覺到它要爆炸了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾人跑去躲在岩石後面，緊緊地縮成一團，試圖依靠岩石擋住爆炸的衝擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "經歷了漫長的等待之後，一絲不妙的聲響逐漸從地下傳了上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗞……兒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "什麼聲音……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石蟲群",
      "text": "（謹慎地縮著）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不過眼前這群看起來都不是赤金源石蟲啊……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "要不然我們先跑，再換個地方找找看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫剛剛覺得自己腳下似乎鬆了一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "嗯，我也聽到腳下有碎裂的聲音，我猜瑪露希爾的魔法應該是不知道為什麼放在了我們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "腳下啊啊啊啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
